            f"   [-] RETICULUM ADDR    : Destination Hash ➔ <{dest_hash.lower()}> [ROUTED]\n"
            f"   [-] SGP4 SAT VECTOR   : Orbit Positioning  ➔ Azimuth: {az}° | Elevation: {el}° [LOCKED]\n"
            f"   [-] GROVER-PROOF SDR  : 256-Bit Demod Data ➔ \033[1;34m{demod_out}\033[0m\n"
            f"   [-] DECRYPTED LAYER   : Cleartext Context  ➔ \033[1;32m{resolved_context}\033[0m\n"
            f"------------------------------------------------------------------------\n"
        )
