\ Configuration: Define node spatial direction addresses
HEX
3FFFF CONSTANT UP_PORT     \ Bitwise address configuration for up port
3FFFE CONSTANT DOWN_PORT   \ Bitwise address configuration for down port
3FFFD CONSTANT LEFT_PORT   \ Bitwise address configuration for left port
\ Core Variables (Stored natively on the fast internal node registers)
VARIABLE EX_HASH           \ Stored expected system base checksum
1A2C3 EX_HASH !            \ Initialize baseline token state parameters
: RECV-BLOCK ( -- n )
